      "id": 1,
      "text": "Herald once housed the 918‑MW Rancho Seco Nuclear Generating Station, whose decommissioned cooling towers still dominate the Central Valley skyline.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
