      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The former nuclear site now hosts a 1,000‑MW gas‑fired plant and a 11‑MW solar array, turning old power infrastructure into clean energy.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Herald%2C_California",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Located east of Galt along State Route 104, Herald developed as a quiet farming community before the nuclear boom.",
